{"words": [{"text": "إِذْ", "translation": "When"}, {"text": "قَالَتِ", "translation": "[she] said"}, {"text": "ٱمْرَأَتُ", "translation": "(the) wife"}, {"text": "عِمْرَٰنَ", "translation": "(of) Imran"}, {"text": "رَبِّ", "translation": "My Lord"}, {"text": "إِنِّى", "translation": "Indeed, I"}, {"text": "نَذَرْتُ", "translation": "[I] vowed"}, {"text": "لَكَ", "translation": "to You"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "what"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "(is) in"}, {"text": "بَطْنِى", "translation": "my womb"}, {"text": "مُحَرَّرًۭا", "translation": "dedicated"}, {"text": "فَتَقَبَّلْ", "translation": "so accept"}, {"text": "مِنِّىٓ ۖ", "translation": "from me"}, {"text": "إِنَّكَ", "translation": "Indeed, You"}, {"text": "أَنتَ", "translation": "You"}, {"text": "ٱلسَّمِيعُ", "translation": "(are) the All-Hearing"}, {"text": "ٱلْعَلِيمُ", "translation": "the All-Knowing"}], "sahih": "[Mention, O Muḥammad], when the wife of ʿImrān said, \"My Lord, indeed I have pledged to You what is in my womb, consecrated [for Your service], so accept this from me. Indeed, You are the Hearing, the Knowing.\""}